.TH SWAYDESK 7 2026-11-14 "swaydesk 0.1.8" "Sway desktop components"
.SH NAME
swaydesk \- Sway desktop components and the Sway Desktop session
.SH DESCRIPTION
The swaydesk packages turn Sway into a desktop: a dock, an application grid, Waybar popups, notifications, a
lock screen, theme tools and the services a desktop session expects.
The components are GTK 4 programs for wlroots compositors with layer\-shell.
.PP
The swaydesk\-desktop package adds the
.B Sway Desktop
session to the display manager.
It starts Sway with the configuration in
.IR /usr/share/swaydesk\-desktop/ ,
and on the first login
.B swaydesk\-desktop\-config setup
copies the user files from
.I /usr/share/swaydesk\-desktop/skel/
into the home folder, without overwriting what is already there.
.SH COMPONENTS
The binaries are in
.IR /usr/bin .
The Sway and Waybar configurations call most of them by their older names (sway\-dock, waybar\-network and
others), which are links in the helper directory to the binaries.
.TP
